            <td>Creating and completing the Aibysitter check run</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td>Pull requests</td>
            <td>Read</td>
            <td>Listing changed files and diffs</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td>Contents</td>
            <td>Read</td>
            <td>Reading files at the head commit</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
