            <td>Read</td>
            <td>Required by GitHub for every App</td>
        </tr>
    </tbody>
</table>

<h3>Uninstall</h3>
<p>Personal account: <strong>Settings → Applications → Installed GitHub Apps → Aibysitter → Configure → Uninstall</strong>. Organization: <strong>Settings → GitHub Apps</strong>, then the same. Reviews stop at once; check runs already posted stay on their pull requests.</p>

<h2>Hosting</h2>
<p>The site is served through Cloudflare, which processes requests under its own privacy policy.</p>
